        "ver": "0.7.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "GK H3 Dataset Builder - SPEECH-AWARE SEGMENTATION\n\nsegmentation = 'speech_aware': the source is transcribed once with Whisper,\nthen clips are tiled so each STARTS at a speech boundary and ENDS as close as\npossible to a sentence boundary - minimizing clips cut mid-sentence. The\ntranscript is reused (sliced per clip) for captioning, so it is cheaper than\nper-clip transcription.\n\nNotes:\n- Requires enable_transcription = True.\n- H3 lengths are quantized (15 discrete durations ~5.17-15.08s), so cuts are\n  near, not exactly on, sentence ends; inter-sentence silence may be dropped.\n- With no detectable speech (music/ambient only) it falls back to fixed_window.\n- Transcription runs up front, so builds spend time transcribing before cutting.\n\nSet 'source_folder' + 'target_folder' and run."
      ],
      "title": "README"
    },
